\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Scheme of the experimental setup. The secondary \ce {^{17}C} impinges on ACTAR TPC, where reactions take place. Emitted light particles are then measured in the TPC using the \textit  {L1} trigger (see text below) and in three Si detector walls. Finally, the ZDD is used to detect in coincidence the heavy recoil. Optimal distances and gas settings are also shown.\relax }}{3}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:setup}{{2}{3}{Scheme of the experimental setup. The secondary \iso {17}{C} impinges on ACTAR TPC, where reactions take place. Emitted light particles are then measured in the TPC using the \textit {L1} trigger (see text below) and in three Si detector walls. Finally, the ZDD is used to detect in coincidence the heavy recoil. Optimal distances and gas settings are also shown.\relax }{figure.caption.3}{}}
